WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.180
I think libraries are the places where
you get information and where you

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:13.200
discuss this information so of course
the libraries can hold a function.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.780
I think most importantly though that
what the libraries can do is to affect

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:23.360
people's will to discuss. I think that they
can maybe help instigate emotions that

00:00:23.369 --> 00:00:26.610
will make them interested in this.
 I don't think we are needing so much the

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.400
information, everybody has access to the
information already,

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.020
but libraries can be a place 
that inspire you to think about this.

